    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Melody Ball&quot; is a high-difficulty rhythm music game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can press any key to the rhythm of the music and enjoy a fun and rich music-based challenge.The core gameplay focuses on precise rhythm judgment with various special note types:<br><strong>Tap</strong>: Hit basic notes with perfect timing.<br><strong>Hold</strong>: Press and hold to complete sliding passages.<br><br><strong>Skins &amp; Items</strong>: Bring more fun to your gameplay.</p>",
